tart protocol is complete and coherent: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were recorded, restart was acknowledged, the boot ID changed, and the system, service, content, firewall configuration, listener, and HTTP response recovered. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["Package-health collection timed out both before and after execution, so package-manager consistency could not be independently assessed.","HTTP behavior was tested from node1 through its managed IP rather than from a separate client, although the wildcard listener and active firewall rule strongly support network availability."]}
